      "id": "01-open",
      "instruction": "Open http://127.0.0.1:8069/ in the browser. If a login page appears, log in with username 'admin' and password '{{env:APP_PASSWORD}}' (type that password text exactly as given into the password field). Then open the Contacts app and create a new contact named '{{runid}} Bench Customer' with its City field set to 'Benchville'. Save the contact and report the exact Name and City values shown on the saved contact page. Note: the app long-polls and is never network-idle, so never wait for network idle; wait for concrete page elements instead.",
      "skill": "s_18c13e",
      "params": {
        "v2": "http://127.0.0.1:8069/",
        "v3": "admin",
        "v4": "{{env:APP_PASSWORD}}",
        "v5": "{{runid}} Bench Customer",
        "v6": "Benchville",
        "v1": "{{runid}}"
      },
